  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nDecoding signs:\n\n \n \n\n Sign\n A\n B\n C\n D\n \n \n\n Stands For\n ÷\n ×\n +\n -\n \n \n\nGiven: 12 C 16 B 15 A 8 D 14 = ?3\n\n12 C 16 B 15 A 8 D 14 = ? ⇒ 12 + 16 × 15 ÷ 8 - 14 = ?3\n\n⇒ 12 + 16 × __**15 **____**÷**____** 8**__ - 14 = ?3\n\n⇒ 12 + __**16 **____**× 1.875**__ - 14 = ?3\n\n⇒ __**12 + 30**__ - 14 = ?3\n\n⇒ __**42**____** - 14**__ = ?3\n\n⇒ 28 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
